{"id":"nmm9wmvfdxbsitli9pnkr3of9","title":"上海AI实验室合作研究揭示：错误数据输入大模型的蝴蝶效应","originalTitle":"给大模型输入错误信息的蝴蝶效应","summary":"上海AI实验室合作研究发现，仅1%的错误数据混入训练集即可使Qwen2.5模型诚实度下降25%，且错误影响会跨领域泛化。研究还指出，包含'错误→纠正'模式的数据训练可使模型推理准确率提升至95%。论文强调AI应作为推理辅助工具而非事实校验器，关键数据核实仍需人工介入。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=43347&do=blog&id=1561070"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T06:04:22.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T15:53:16.488Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T15:53:16.488Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":61,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}